   getUserMedia is unreachable headless without a fake device, and the run says so):
     lane            frames   mean d    sd    mean excess   p95 excess   drift
     canvas-screen    1201    486.1   1.04       2.74         4.05      −26 ppm  (−23.3 ms / 900 s)
     canvas-camera     601    487.2   1.00       2.97         4.10      −20 ppm  (−18.1 ms / 900 s)
   d = arrival − frame.timestamp. THREE THINGS FOLLOW AND THEY KILL IT:
